{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">肥媽在節目《在家宴客60道菜》中，特別示範了一道極具東南亞風味的「泰式素豆腐」。這道菜式巧妙地將豆腐壓乾水分，炒出猶如肉鬆般的香脆口感，再融合香茅、南薑、金不換與薄荷等多種香料，最後配上新鮮生菜包裹食用，味道層次極為豐富，絕對能為味蕾帶來新衝擊！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"8024eeae-a5e1-413a-9e2b-f8210ef768cc.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026niPKV2nXH41791256044.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"8024eeae-a5e1-413a-9e2b-f8210ef768cc.png.webp\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>食材</strong></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>做法</strong></p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"b04fdedb-9062-446b-9058-4ca14fe6fae2.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/20264d66KYG7hg1791256045.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"b04fdedb-9062-446b-9058-4ca14fe6fae2.png.webp\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><s